Cell["\<\
Here we repeat the  procedure but starting with an initial population of full \
cooperators. We keeps track of the proportion of the initial strategies that \
lead to the loss of cooperation from fixation .\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9805069354989815`*^9, 
  3.9805069810518856`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a89e471d-ff7d-1148-8c1f-\
